                        "<p>You can toggle to view your sidebar of mood boards here.</p>",
                    introSidebar: "<div class='title'>Mood board sidebar</div>" +
                        "<p>Consider creating different mood boards for tone, style, locations,  talent, costumes, set dressing, props, and more.</p>"
                });

